## Development workflows

### Start the stack (Docker)

```bash
dude up --build   # first time
dude up           # subsequent runs
```

Services:

| Service  | URL                              |
|----------|----------------------------------|
| Frontend | http://localhost                 |
| API      | http://localhost:8000            |
| Health   | http://localhost:8000/api/health |

### Local development (no Docker)

```bash
# Backend (terminal 1)
cd backend
uv sync
uv run uvicorn app.main:app --reload   # http://localhost:8000

# Frontend (terminal 2)
cd frontend
pnpm install
pnpm dev                               # http://localhost:5173
```

### After changing backend routes

```bash
dude api sync      # regenerate the typed client
dude api review    # sanity-check the generated output
```

