## What Claude should NOT do

- Edit anything under `frontend/src/openapi/` — it is auto-generated. Run `dude api sync` instead.
- Edit `security/baseline.json` by hand — use `dude security accept` or `dude security verify --remove-resolved`.
- Add files to `private/` to version control — it is gitignored.
- Use `pip install` — always `uv add <package>` for backend dependencies.
- Use `npm` or `yarn` — always `pnpm` for frontend dependencies.

